RS Chebyshev Ni(001) surface, calctype S, nsp=2, U=3/J=0.7 local on types 1 (frozen Ni host), 3 (Ni-S), 4 (Ni-S-1); ES without U. Same geometry and recursion settings as ni001_u3 (lld=200, 2500 channels, beta 0.005 Broyden, ldm_beta 0.3). input.nml is the SOC-on z-axis smoke run (nstep 5, fermi -0.076576 = host_soc E_F); fermi must equal the E_F of the host in use.

Files: ES.nml, Ni-S.nml, Ni-S-1.nml, Ni-S_dm.nml, Ni-S-1_dm.nml: the *_out.nml and dm files of the 200-step ni001_u3 run (nsp=1, Diff about 3e-6 oscillating) used as seeds, zero spin coherences. host_soc0/: nsp=2 host with soc_scale=0 and fix_soc (b2, see ni_host_soc). host_soc/: nsp=2 SOC-on host, converged b1 (ni_host_soc README), E_F -0.076843. Copy one host's Ni.nml and Ni_dm.nml next to input.nml before a run; soc_scale=0 and fix_soc go in &self for the SOC->0 runs.

Short runs, per-step values from the log (d trace, spin moment mspin, orbital moment |L| in muB, max |P_up,dn|):
SOC->0 against nsp=1, iteration 1 (host_soc0 against its nsp=1 copy with the same numbers; spinor_d line dropped, hubbard_nsp 1, new dm hash): Diff 3.1737e-6 in both; max |delta ql| 6.9e-18 (Ni-S-1), 0 (ES, Ni-S); gravity_center 1.4e-16. Against the independently converged ni001_u3 host the same run differs by max |delta ql| 2.5e-10 and Diff 3.1727e-6 against 3.1737e-6 (host difference, see ni_host_soc); etot differs by up to 1.9e-8 Ry in both comparisons (not diagnosed). max |P_up,dn| 0.
